  destinationId: ngc1501
  plateAssetPath: Assets/Textures/ngc1501_texture.jpg
  Provenance: 'Depth derived, not invented: the object is a roughly spherical shell of ejecta, so a point at image radius r sits at z = +/- R*sqrt(1 - r^2). The limb brightening that projection causes is divided back out of the density so the rim is not counted twice. Colour is the plate''s own.'
  radiusMetres: 0.6
